{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"setDisposeFunction"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"dispose"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"GSourceDisposeFunc","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:@T@GSourceDisposeFunc"},{"kind":"text","text":"?)"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","level":2,"text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"code":"dispose","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" function will be called once the reference count of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"source"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reaches zero but before any of the state of the source is freed, especially"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"before the finalize function (set as part of the [type"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib\/SourceFuncs","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":"]) is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"called.","type":"text"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This means that at this point "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"source"},{"text":" is still a valid [struct","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib\/Source"},{"type":"text","text":"]"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and it is allow for the reference count to increase again until ","type":"text"},{"code":"dispose","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"returns."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The dispose function can be used to clear any ‘weak’ references to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"the "},{"code":"source","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" in other data structures in a thread-safe way where it is"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"possible for another thread to increase the reference count of ","type":"text"},{"code":"source","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" again","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"while it is being freed."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The finalize function can not be used for this purpose as at that","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"point ","type":"text"},{"code":"source","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is already partially freed and not valid any more."}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This should only ever be called from [struct","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib\/Source","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":"] implementations."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/glib\/sourceprotocol\/setdisposefunction(dispose:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib","doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib\/SourceProtocol"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib\/SourceProtocol\/setDisposeFunction(dispose:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"text":"Set ","type":"text"},{"code":"dispose","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" as dispose function on "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"source"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"metadata":{"extendedModule":"GLib","externalID":"s:4GLib14SourceProtocolPAAE18setDisposeFunction7disposeyySpySo8_GSourceVGSgXCSg_tF","role":"symbol","title":"setDisposeFunction(dispose:)","modules":[{"name":"GLib"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"setDisposeFunction"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"text":"dispose","kind":"externalParam"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:@T@GSourc